      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Will I be forced to buy insurance?
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">No. The assessment helps you understand your protection priorities. Advisor support is optional.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Is my information private?
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Your answers are used to prepare your private report. Do not send passwords, bank details, BVN, NIN, or card information through the assessment.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        <div class="faq-question">
          What happens after I receive my report?
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">You can review your report privately. If you want support, you can choose to request contact from a CoverScore Risk Advisor.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Can I stop or continue later?
          <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
